{"product_id":"my-life-as-a-stuntboy-the-my-life-series","title":"My Life as a Stuntboy (The My Life series)","description":"\u003cp\u003eDerek Fallon gets the opportunity of a lifetime―to be a stunt boy in a major movie featuring a pretty teen starlet. After accepting the job he learns that he is the star's stunt double and must wear a wig! His friends are never going to let him live this down. If that weren't his only problem, his parents are threatening to give away his pet monkey, and his best friend just posted an embarrassing video of him on Youtube. Can life get any worse? Still the irrepressible Derek takes it all in stride and even manages to save the day.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 147 x 218\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jake Tashjian\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780805089042\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 272\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803735351449,"sku":"16RA-3-9780805089042","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d505b3b6cb7_My_Life_as_a_Stuntboy__The_My_Life_series__Jake_Tashjian.jpg?v=1760808687","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/my-life-as-a-stuntboy-the-my-life-series","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}